"The folder hierarchy where backups are stored. Paths can be absolute or "
"relative to your home directory."
msgstr ""
"Mappehierarki hvor sikkerhetskopier blir lagret. Du kan bruke absolutte "
"eller hjemmemappe-relative stier."

